@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
# TEMPORARY: until Spring Security lands, the member comes from X-Member-Id (local profile
# only). Create one first, for example:
#   docker compose exec db psql -U mozzi -c "insert into member (email, nickname, provider, provider_subject, role, status, created_at, updated_at) values ('dev@gmail.com', 'dev', 'GOOGLE', 'dev', 'USER', 'ACTIVE', now(), now()) returning member_id;"
@memberId = 1

### Save today's diary (change recordDate to today). Expect 201 with image.status PENDING.
POST {{baseUrl}}/diaries
X-Member-Id: {{memberId}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recordDate": "2026-10-27",
  "emotion": "CALM",
  "activities": ["REST", "FAMILY"],
  "memo": "퇴근하고 오므라이스를 만들어 먹었어"
}

### Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/diaries/1
X-Member-Id: {{memberId}}

### List, newest first, with optional filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/diaries?size=20&emotion=CALM&activity=FAMILY&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
X-Member-Id: {{memberId}}

### Change only the fields sent ("" clears the memo, [] clears the activities)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/diaries/1
X-Member-Id: {{memberId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "emotion": "HAPPY", "activities": ["REST"], "memo": "수정한 한 줄" }

### Soft delete. Expect 204; the day can be written again afterwards.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/diaries/1
X-Member-Id: {{memberId}}
